# Pi-hole Blocklists
# These lists are automatically applied on Pi-hole startup and updates
# Each line should contain a single URL to a blocklist

# StevenBlack's Unified Hosts - Comprehensive ad and malware blocking
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StevenBlack/hosts/master/hosts

# AdGuard DNS Filter - Mobile and web ad blocking
https://adguardteam.github.io/AdGuardSDNSFilter/Filters/filter.txt

# EasyList - Primary ad blocking list
https://easylist.to/easylist/easylist.txt

# EasyPrivacy - Tracking and analytics blocking
https://easylist.to/easylist/easyprivacy.txt

# Peter Lowe's Ad and tracking server list
https://pgl.yoyo.org/adservers/serverlist.php?hostformat=hosts&showintro=0&mimetype=plaintext

# Malicious URL Blocklist (URLhaus)
https://malware-filter.gitlab.io/malware-filter/urlhaus-filter-hosts.txt

# Phishing Army - Phishing domain blocklist
https://phishing.army/download/phishing_army_blocklist_extended.txt
